        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakandaambila kuti, O mwana amuntu, ezi zifuwa ndoluzubo loonse lwa-Israyeli. Balaamba kuti, Mal Zifuwa zyesu ziliyuminide, twafwidwa ncetulangila, twanyonyooka buyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
