        {
          "text": "Bayookala munyika eyo njiyonya mobakakede bamauso, nyika njendakapa mulanda wangu Jakobo. Bayookala mulinjiyo, balo abana babo abana babana babo, lyoonse buyo mane kukabe kutamani. Nkabela Davida mulanda wangu nguuyooba mweendelezi wabo kukabe kutamani. ",
